      "id": "7b4431799967-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The Ganesh-rath is one of the finest monolithic temples at _____________. &#2327;&#2339;&#2375;&#2358;-&#2352;&#2341; _____________ &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2375;&#2361;&#2340;&#2352;&#2368;&#2344; &#2309;&#2326;&#2306;&#2337; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Ganesh-rath is one of the finest monolithic temples at _____________.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2327;&#2339;&#2375;&#2358;-&#2352;&#2341; _____________ &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2375;&#2361;&#2340;&#2352;&#2368;&#2344; &#2309;&#2326;&#2306;&#2337; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Mahabalipuram &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2348;&#2354;&#2368;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mahabalipuram</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2348;&#2354;&#2368;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Sarnath &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;&#2341;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Sarnath</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;&#2341;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Gangaikondacholapuram &#2327;&#2306;&#2327;&#2312;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306;&#2337;&#2330;&#2379;&#2354;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Gangaikondacholapuram</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2327;&#2306;&#2327;&#2312;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306;&#2337;&#2330;&#2379;&#2354;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Kanchipuram &#2325;&#2366;&#2306;&#2330;&#2368;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Kanchipuram</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2366;&#2306;&#2330;&#2368;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>&#183; <b>Ganesh Ratha Overview:</b> A monolithic rock-cut temple in <b>Mahabalipuram</b>, Tamil Nadu, carved during the Pallava dynasty (7th - 8th century CE). It is part of the Pancha Rathas, a UNESCO World Heritage Site.</p><p>&#183; <b>Features:</b> Carved from a single granite boulder, it resembles a chariot (ratha) and is dedicated to Lord Ganesha, though originally to another deity.</p><p>&#183; <b>Other Options:</b></p><p>o <b>Sarnath:</b> Known for Buddhist stupas, not rock-cut temples.</p><p>o <b>Gangaikondacholapuram:</b> Features Chola architecture, not monolithic rathas.</p><p>o <b>Kanchipuram:</b> Known for structural temples like Kailasanatha, not monolithic ones.</p><p><b>Further Insights:</b></p><p>&#183; <b>Pancha Rathas:</b> Named after the Pandavas (Draupadi, Arjuna, Bhima, Dharmaraja, Nakula-Sahadeva), these temples showcase diverse Dravidian architectural styles.</p><p>&#183; <b>Pallava Legacy:</b> Mahabalipuram's rock-cut architecture influenced later South Indian temple designs, seen in Chola and Vijayanagara periods.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7b4431799967-q2",
