      "question": "Where is Kandariya Mahadev Temple situated? &#2325;&#2306;&#2342;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2342;&#2375;&#2357; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Where is Kandariya Mahadev Temple situated?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2325;&#2306;&#2342;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2342;&#2375;&#2357; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Deogarh &#2342;&#2375;&#2357;&#2327;&#2338;&#2364;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Deogarh</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2375;&#2357;&#2327;&#2338;&#2364;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Modhera &#2350;&#2379;&#2338;&#2375;&#2352;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Modhera</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2379;&#2338;&#2375;&#2352;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Aurangabad &#2324;&#2352;&#2306;&#2327;&#2366;&#2348;&#2366;&#2342;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Aurangabad</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2324;&#2352;&#2306;&#2327;&#2366;&#2348;&#2366;&#2342;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Khajuraho &#2326;&#2332;&#2369;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2379;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Khajuraho</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2326;&#2332;&#2369;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2379;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>Kandariya Mahadeva Temple is located in the Chhatarpur district of Madhya Pradesh in Central India. It is in the Khajuraho village, and the temple complex is spread over an area of 6 square kilometers (2.3 sq mi).</p>",
