    {
      "id": "7b4431799967-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "The lofty gates erected in the courtyard of the temples in south India were called ________. &#2342;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2339; &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2306;&#2327;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2344;&#2375; &#2314;&#2306;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; ________ &#2325;&#2361;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The lofty gates erected in the courtyard of the temples in south India were called ________.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2339; &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2306;&#2327;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2344;&#2375; &#2314;&#2306;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; ________ &#2325;&#2361;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "mandap &#2350;&#2306;&#2337;&#2346;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">mandap</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2306;&#2337;&#2346;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "ardhmandap &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2350;&#2306;&#2337;&#2346;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">ardhmandap</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2350;&#2306;&#2337;&#2346;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "vimana &#2357;&#2367;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">vimana</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "gopuram &#2327;&#2379;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">gopuram</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2327;&#2379;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The lofty gates in the courtyard of South Indian temples are known as \"<b>gopuram</b>.\" These are elaborate and ornate entrance towers that often depict intricate sculptures and serve as monumental and symbolic entrances to the temple complex.</p>",
