      "number": 4,
      "question": "The Sun Temple at Konark was built under the rule of which dynasty? &#2325;&#2379;&#2339;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358; &#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2366;&#2360;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Sun Temple at Konark was built under the rule of which dynasty?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2325;&#2379;&#2339;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358; &#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2366;&#2360;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Pallava Dynasty &#2346;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2357; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Pallava Dynasty</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2357; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Pandya Dynasty &#2346;&#2366;&#2306;&#2337;&#2381;&#2351; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Pandya Dynasty</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2366;&#2306;&#2337;&#2381;&#2351; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Eastern Ganga Dynasty &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2368; &#2327;&#2306;&#2327;&#2366; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Eastern Ganga Dynasty</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2368; &#2327;&#2306;&#2327;&#2366; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Rashtrakuta Dynasty &#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2370;&#2335; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rashtrakuta Dynasty</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2370;&#2335; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>&bull; The Sun Temple at Konark was built in 13th century CE by <b>King Narasimhadeva I</b> of the <b>Eastern Ganga Dynasty.</b></p><p>&bull; The temple is shaped like a chariot and dedicated to the Sun God, Surya.</p><p>&bull; The temple is a UNESCO World Heritage Site, known for its architectural brilliance and intricate carvings.</p>",
