    {
      "id": "7b4431799967-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "The Hindu temples 'Hinglaj Mata' and 'Katasraj' are located in which neighbouring country of India? &#2361;&#2367;&#2306;&#2342;&#2370; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; '&#2361;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2366;&#2332; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366;' &#2324;&#2352; '&#2325;&#2335;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;' &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2337;&#2364;&#2379;&#2360;&#2368; &#2342;&#2375;&#2358; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Hindu temples 'Hinglaj Mata' and 'Katasraj' are located in which neighbouring country of India?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2361;&#2367;&#2306;&#2342;&#2370; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; '&#2361;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2366;&#2332; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366;' &#2324;&#2352; '&#2325;&#2335;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;' &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2337;&#2364;&#2379;&#2360;&#2368; &#2342;&#2375;&#2358; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Pakistan &#2346;&#2366;&#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Pakistan</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2366;&#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Bhutan &#2349;&#2370;&#2335;&#2366;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Bhutan</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2349;&#2370;&#2335;&#2366;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Sri Lanka &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2354;&#2306;&#2325;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Sri Lanka</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2354;&#2306;&#2325;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Nepal &#2344;&#2375;&#2346;&#2366;&#2354;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Nepal</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2375;&#2346;&#2366;&#2354;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>&#183; <b>Hinglaj Mata Temple:</b> Located in Balochistan, <b>Pakistan</b>, it is a major Shakti Peeth, revered by Hindus for Goddess Hinglaj (a form of Durga).</p><p>&#183; <b>Katasraj Temple:</b> In Punjab province, <b>Pakistan</b>, a historic complex dedicated to Lord Shiva, known for its sacred pond.</p><p>&#183; <b>Context:</b> Both are significant pilgrimage sites for Hindus, maintained despite Pakistan's Muslim-majority population.</p>",
