      "question": "Brihadiswara Temple, which exhibits Dravidian temple architecture, is located in: &#2348;&#2371;&#2361;&#2342;&#2368;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352;, &#2332;&#2379; &#2342;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2367;&#2337;&#2364; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369;&#2325;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2325;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Brihadiswara Temple, which exhibits Dravidian temple architecture, is located in:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2348;&#2371;&#2361;&#2342;&#2368;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352;, &#2332;&#2379; &#2342;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2367;&#2337;&#2364; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369;&#2325;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2325;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Thanjavur &#2340;&#2306;&#2332;&#2366;&#2357;&#2369;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Thanjavur</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2306;&#2332;&#2366;&#2357;&#2369;&#2352;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Dharmapuri &#2343;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Dharmapuri</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2343;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Madurai &#2350;&#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2376;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Madurai</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2376;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Thiruvananthapuram &#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2369;&#2357;&#2344;&#2306;&#2340;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Thiruvananthapuram</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2369;&#2357;&#2344;&#2306;&#2340;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>&#8226; The <b>Brihadiswara Temple</b> is located in <b>Thanjavur</b>, Tamil Nadu.</p><p>&#8226; Built by <b>Raja Raja Chola I</b> in the 11th century, it is a masterpiece of <b>Chola architecture</b>.</p><p>&#8226; The temple is a UNESCO World Heritage Site and a prime example of <b>Dravidian style temple architecture</b>, noted for its towering vimana and granite construction.</p>",
