      "question": "The Mahabodhi Temple Complex has direct association with the life of the______. &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2348;&#2379;&#2343;&#2367; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; ______ &#2325;&#2375; &#2332;&#2368;&#2357;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2368;&#2343;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Mahabodhi Temple Complex has direct association with the life of the______.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2348;&#2379;&#2343;&#2367; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; ______ &#2325;&#2375; &#2332;&#2368;&#2357;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2368;&#2343;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
