          "text": "Chandella dynasty &#2330;&#2306;&#2342;&#2375;&#2354; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Chandella dynasty</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2306;&#2342;&#2375;&#2354; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Nanda dynasty &#2344;&#2306;&#2342; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Nanda dynasty</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2306;&#2342; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Vijayanagar dynasty &#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2351;&#2344;&#2327;&#2352; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Vijayanagar dynasty</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2351;&#2344;&#2327;&#2352; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>During the period of 950 to 1050, the Khajuraho temples were constructed under the <b>Chandella dynasty</b>.</p>",
